message.content:
This is a commercial still for producing spirits, heated electrically. HTSUS 8419.40 covers distilling or rectifying plant. Within it, 8419.40.00 has a statistical suffix: 8419.40.00 00 (Distilling or rectifying plant). The heading 8419 covers machinery, plant or laboratory equipment, electrically heated or not, for treatment of materials by a process involving a change of temperature, such as heating or cooling. The CBP ruling on a similar still (a Barrel-type still from Portugal) classified it under 8419.40.00.

Subheading 8419.40.00 is the one for "Distilling or rectifying plant," with the statistical suffix 8419.40.0000.

{"hts_code": "8419.40.0000", "reason": "The S-800 is a commercial distilling plant with a kettle, reflux column and condenser that treats the wash by heating and condensing, so it falls under heading 8419 as distilling or rectifying plant."}
